1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,383
Reg CF investment limits depend
on whether you are an accredited

2
00:00:04,383 --> 00:00:07,327
investor and, for non-accredited
investors,

3
00:00:07,327 --> 00:00:09,450
on annual income and net worth.

4
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:15,103
If either measure is below
$124,000, the 12-month limit is the

5
00:00:15,103 --> 00:00:19,388
greater of $2,500 or 5% of the
greater measure.

6
00:00:19,388 --> 00:00:25,412
If both are at least $124,000, it is
10% of the greater measure.

7
00:00:25,412 --> 00:00:30,501
Under either formula, the
aggregate cap is $124,000 across

8
00:00:30,501 --> 00:00:34,538
all Reg CF offerings in any rolling
12 months.

9
00:00:34,538 --> 00:00:39,949
For example, with income of
$50,000 and net worth of

10
00:00:39,949 --> 00:00:47,025
$40,000, 5% of the greater figure
is $2,500, so the limit is $2,500.

11
00:00:47,025 --> 00:00:52,256
With income of $150,000 and net
worth

12
00:00:52,256 --> 00:00:57,488
of $80,000, 5% of $150,000 is
$7,500.

13
00:00:57,488 --> 00:01:01,162
Track commitments across
portals, not one app.

14
00:01:01,162 --> 00:01:05,184
Net-worth rules exclude your
primary residence and treat some

15
00:01:05,184 --> 00:01:06,700
related debt specially.

16
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:09,576
Accredited investors are not
subject

17
00:01:09,576 --> 00:01:11,812
to Reg CF investment limits.

18
00:01:11,812 --> 00:01:14,023
Verify current rules and how the

19
00:01:14,023 --> 00:01:17,616
intermediary calculates your limit
before investing.

